{"type":"message","id":"57284602","parentId":"97afb446","timestamp":"2026-05-18T07:49:07.931Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The root endpoint returns \"Unauthorized\" for GET, and the /send endpoint returns \"ECHO Agent Platform v0.2\" for GET. So the endpoint is there but returning 500 on POST.\n\nLet me try with a different content format, maybe the issue is with the JSON body.\n\nActually, let me try with an empty content field or different structure. Let me also check if maybe there's a size limit or something.\n\nWait, let me look at the CF-Ray: 9fd94239ac2fd576-NRT - NRT is the Narita (Tokyo) datacenter. Maybe there's a specific regional issue.\n\nError 1101 from the platform (not from CF) - the platform's error code 1101. \n\nThe platform might be running into internal limits or validation constraints. Let me attempt a minimal POST request with just the essential fields to see if that passes through.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n\n"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"call-6ee133d2-5aad-4fdc-a1ec-7aa465b773d3","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"curl -s -X POST \"https://echo-agent-platform.zhouyating.workers.dev/send\" \\\n  -H \"X-API-KEY: echo-agent-2026-secure-key\" \\\n  -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n  --data-raw '{\"threadId\":\"arbitration\",\"content\":\"Heartbeat 07:45 UTC\"}' 2>&1"}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":20024,"output":284,"cacheRead":112,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":20420,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1779090535459,"responseId":"chatcmpl-4ac0e6b3-a3f8-4e9f-968d-970121099a39"}}
